#about-section
  .body_div
    .verticle_center
      .title About
      .blurb Hey! My name is Stephanie Claudino Daffara, but I go by Ste. I am currently in my last semester at UCBerkeley studying Computer Science. The classes I take focus on Graphics and Machine learning; the research projects I participate in involve Data Science and Visualization; and the collaborations I do with professors involve Augmented Reality and Art. For fun I lead an Immersive Cinema Research and Production group.
      .blurb In the same way that I practice furthering my own knowledge, I actively seek projects and research teams that focus on the intersection of technology and education pushing for a reality where everyone has easy access to education and the mental, emotional and financial freedom to follow their creative passions.
      .blurb So if you are looking for a hand in software development, design or immersive experiences lets talk:
        a.sub-link(href="mailto:stephaniecd@berkeley.edu") stephaniecd@berkeley.edu
      a.sub-link(href="https://github.com/stecd", target="_blank") github
